==German==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈkastən/|lang=de}}

===Etymology 1===
{{etym|goh|de}} {{term|kasto|lang=goh}}.

====Noun====
{{de-noun|m|Kastens|Kästen|pl2=Kasten}}

# [[crate]] (e.g. for bottles)
# {{context|regional|Germany|lang=de}} [[box]], [[case]]
# {{context|regional|Austria and parts of southern Germany|lang=de}} [[cupboard]]

====Usage notes====
* The normal plural is '''''Kästen'''''.
* The unchanged plural ''Kasten'' is now widely obsolete. (In the 19th century, however, the [[umlaut]] form was still deprecated, for example as “wrong” in Grimm's ''Deutsches Wörterbuch''.)

